{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"37":"The Book of Fighting [The Prohibition of Bloodshed]"},"section_detail":{"37":{"hadithnumber_first":3966,"hadithnumber_last":4132,"arabicnumber_first":3966,"arabicnumber_last":4132,"name_native":"যুদ্ধের বই [রক্তপাতের নিষেধাজ্ঞা]"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4099,"arabicnumber":4099,"text":"আবূ দাউদ (রহঃ) ... ইবন যুবায়র (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত। তিনি বলেন, যে ব্যাক্তি অস্ত্র উঠিয়ে চালাবে তার রক্ত বৃথা যাবে।","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Muquf"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Muquf"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":37,"hadith":134}}]}